  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kitumaini 2030 Haut-Katanga</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity is to improve the response to HIV to ensure sustained epidemic control in targeted geographic areas. Activities will contribute to the reduction of DRC&apos;s HIV burden through decreasing new infections and hiv-associated morbidity and mortality in haut-katanga. Implementers will address the condition that enable the uptake of HIV services at the provincial levels to increase the DRC&apos;s contribution to the worldwide goa; of ending the HIV epidemic as a public threat by 2030.</narrative>
  </description>
